  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Macroeconomic Emergency Program to Protect Economic and Social Development</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Macroeconmico para Proteger el Desarrollo Econmico y Social</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es apoyar los esfuerzos del gobierno para restaurar la sostenibilidad macroeconmica y fiscal. Los objetivos especficos del programa son: (i) implementar ajustes fiscales para restaurar la sostenibilidad fiscal; (ii) proteger la autnoma financiera del Banco Central de Suriname y fortalecer los marcos de poltcia cambiaria y monetaria; (iii) mejorar el monitoreo de las principales entidades bancarias y sus requerimientos de capital; y (iv) reducir vulnerabilidades a la corrupcin y promover la inversin y el crecimiento.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to support the Government&apos;s efforts to restore macroeconomic and fiscal sustainability. The specific objectives of the program are to: (i) ensure fiscal adjustment to restore fiscal sustainability; (ii) protect the Central Bank of Suriname&apos;s financial autonomy and strengthen the exchange rate and monetary policy frameworks; (iii) enhance the monitoring of the largest banks and potential recapitalization needs; and (iv) reduce vulnerabilities to corruption and promote investment and growth.</narrative>
  </description>
